SCHEMA_INSUFFICIENT: The schema lacks a predicate such as `violates_section (Person Animal Int) Bool` (or individual predicates for each statutory section like 61.022, 62.003, 62.0031, 62.004, 62.005) to represent that the killing or wounding was done in violation of a specific code section. Without this, the critical condition "in violation of Section 61.022, 62.003, 62.0031, 62.004, or 62.005" cannot be faithfully encoded.